00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:24.820
DM: So while you're helping the rangers get the perimeter established around Isengai as the ash has stopped falling,

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:30.900
DM: one evening you take a moment to pull the mirror of the past out of your porthole,

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:32.620
DM: and

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:37.640
DM: take the pile of ash that Kenzo or Seeker, I forget who,

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:44.320
DM: grabbed from the decaying elemental as you killed her in the plane of Limbo, and hold it up to the mirror.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.340
DM: And as you do, you see

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:51.220
DM: an image.

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:54.260
