00:06:54.636 --> 00:06:56.596
DM: And as it does, everywhere it passes,

00:06:57.896 --> 00:07:01.736
DM: uh, lightning flashes, and as it flashes things freeze

00:07:02.776 --> 00:07:13.335
DM: or burst into flames or turn into a wave of sound that blows across as a discordant note until this thundercloud

00:07:13.335 --> 00:07:18.796
