00:07:18.796 --> 00:07:23.336
DM: But as it passes across something it immediately solidifies back into a person,

00:07:24.536 --> 00:07:25.336
DM: The Queen of Ash,

00:07:26.356 --> 00:07:27.936
DM: and that's where the mirror vision ends.

