Unknown: Oh, yeah.

02:51:41.392 --> 02:51:42.492
DM: So we gotta stick with-

02:51:42.992 --> 02:51:43.332
Unknown: Totally

02:51:43.332 --> 02:51:47.112
DM: ... is everybody makes up their own backstory with their own goals,

02:51:48.052 --> 02:51:51.392
