02:53:59.812 --> 02:54:07.232
Kenzo: Like if you are, if there is some situation where it's like there, you know, it's like the agency is successful in doing that, and then you are just this like, you know,

02:54:08.272 --> 02:54:08.372
Unknown: you know.

02:54:08.372 --> 02:54:09.212
Unknown: New life.

02:54:09.252 --> 02:54:09.632
DM: Right.

02:54:09.672 --> 02:54:11.932
Seeker: Well, no, but that's how you end up on like a-

02:54:12.932 --> 02:54:13.612
Unknown: Like a mining station

02:54:13.612 --> 02:54:15.432
