02:54:15.772 --> 02:54:16.972
Unknown: Yeah. Got it, got it.

02:54:16.992 --> 02:54:20.172
DM: I, I mean, do we wanna do a whole year of starting in prisons games?

02:54:20.172 --> 02:54:20.552
DM: [laughs]

02:54:20.572 --> 02:54:21.052
Unknown: We could.

02:54:23.412 --> 02:54:26.572
Unknown: It's working.

02:54:26.592 --> 02:54:29.612
Kenzo: Well, I, I like just like the waking up and you don't know where the fuck you are or what the hell is going on.

02:54:29.612 --> 02:54:29.892
DM: Yeah, but I-

02:54:30.192 --> 02:54:31.032
Kenzo: Like that, that's like a cool-

02:54:31.072 --> 02:54:31.572
DM: Well-

02:54:31.632 --> 02:54:31.912
Unknown: I like that

02:54:31.912 --> 02:54:36.752
DM: ... I really seriously might, I mean, that might work really well for cam- the start of campaign three.

02:54:37.712 --> 02:54:38.392
Unknown: Love it.

02:54:38.392 --> 02:54:38.552
DM: But

02:54:40.112 --> 02:54:42.052
