02:54:44.192 --> 02:54:48.812
Delwath: I have an idea that sort of you don't know exactly where you are, but you do know...

02:54:50.351 --> 02:54:52.432
Delwath: I haven't quite figured it out, so I can't say the details yet.

02:54:52.452 --> 02:54:53.392
