02:54:58.452 --> 02:54:58.712
Unknown: Mm.

02:54:58.732 --> 02:55:01.872
Delwath: But I kinda like the idea of running something kinda far away from,

02:55:03.872 --> 02:55:04.092
Unknown: like

02:55:05.032 --> 02:55:08.132
Delwath: not, like you're not just in a town, right?

02:55:08.132 --> 02:55:08.752
Unknown: Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.

02:55:08.772 --> 02:55:09.152
Unknown: You're like

02:55:10.272 --> 02:55:13.712
Delwath: out in the far north somewhere with, you know,

02:55:15.032 --> 02:55:16.992
Delwath: not a lot of people around.

02:55:16.992 --> 02:55:18.352
Delwath: And so how did you end up there?

02:55:18.352 --> 02:55:18.712
Unknown: I don't...

02:55:19.912 --> 02:55:29.932
Delwath: There would presumably have to be some sort of like quest that, or goal that you previously had that's now been thwarted because something went horribly wrong, and now you're stuck

02:55:29.932 --> 02:55:32.252
Delwath: trying to... And then the, the

02:55:33.612 --> 02:55:36.852
Delwath: actual adventure starts after the horribly wrong thing.

02:55:36.852 --> 02:55:39.172
Delwath: But you'd know what the horribly... We'd have to make up what the horrible...

02:55:39.172 --> 02:55:44.612
