02:56:12.252 --> 02:56:13.652
Kenzo: Right? 'Cause like then it's sort of like...

02:56:13.652 --> 02:56:14.172
Unknown: 'Cause the plot, the-

02:56:14.232 --> 02:56:14.312
Unknown: Yeah

02:56:14.312 --> 02:56:19.012
Kenzo: ... the plot twisty thing feels more like, yeah, like the DM just knows and then like springs on everybody, and they're like, "Yeah, right."

02:56:19.032 --> 02:56:22.732
Delwath: But you can do plot twist. I mean, you can do plot twists.

02:56:22.732 --> 02:56:24.132
Delwath: It's a little bit harder

02:56:25.432 --> 02:56:27.752
Delwath: to plot twist Tim.

02:56:27.752 --> 02:56:33.972
Kenzo: [laughs] In Talgar it's, it's probably impossible to plot twist Tim.

02:56:35.612 --> 02:56:39.152
Delwath: I mean, it's hard to do like the Tim level like-

02:56:39.552 --> 02:56:39.812
Unknown: Yeah, yeah, yeah

02:56:39.812 --> 02:56:40.672
Delwath: ... it turns out-

02:56:41.452 --> 02:56:41.712
Unknown: Yeah, yeah

02:56:41.712 --> 02:56:43.472
Delwath: ... like Paulion and Shemot were having an...

02:56:43.472 --> 02:56:43.632
Unknown: You know?

02:56:43.692 --> 02:56:44.932
Unknown: Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

02:56:45.832 --> 02:56:47.412
