02:56:52.332 --> 02:56:52.712
Unknown: ... the backstory and the context. Right?

02:56:52.712 --> 02:56:54.032
Kenzo: Yeah, totally. Totally. Yeah, yeah. Okay.

02:56:54.032 --> 02:56:54.972
Unknown: I get it. Yeah.

02:56:54.992 --> 02:56:59.752
Delwath: And it's easy to actually set, like in this con- Like, so, okay, let's say in this i- this idea I have,

02:57:01.012 --> 02:57:01.912
