02:58:13.992 --> 02:58:15.072
Kenzo: It's like shit like, um...

02:58:15.432 --> 02:58:15.452
Unknown: Mm

02:58:15.452 --> 02:58:20.672
Kenzo: Yeah, you're like traveling in this like mountain, and then you see crash into the side of the mountain like a ship.

02:58:21.292 --> 02:58:21.792
Unknown: All right.

02:58:21.792 --> 02:58:22.332
Unknown: You know? And you're like-

