Unknown: It was cool

03:15:15.200 --> 03:15:17.060
Seeker: ... try stuff, and then some things kind of like-

03:15:17.300 --> 03:15:17.500
Unknown: Yeah.

03:15:17.680 --> 03:15:17.940
DM: Yeah.

