03:20:35.120 --> 03:20:36.500
Kenzo: 'Cause like Faldric was flying the ship.

03:20:36.540 --> 03:20:36.700
Unknown: Right.

03:20:36.700 --> 03:20:38.120
Kenzo: So we always were like, "Oh, fuck.

03:20:38.120 --> 03:20:39.440
Kenzo: Fuck. Where'd, where did Faldric take the ship?"

03:20:39.460 --> 03:20:39.500
Unknown: Yeah. Yeah.

03:20:39.500 --> 03:20:41.960
Kenzo: So it was like, it was always kind of like Faldric had that role.

03:20:42.040 --> 03:20:42.220
Unknown: Yeah.

03:20:42.220 --> 03:20:42.260
DM: Yeah.

03:20:42.260 --> 03:20:44.100
Kenzo: You know? So there was like a reason why we'd be...

03:20:44.100 --> 03:20:47.740
Kenzo: 'Cause like you wouldn't go back to the town just to like check in on the tattoo artist just to check in.

03:20:47.740 --> 03:20:50.260
Kenzo: It's like, oh, fuck, like we want Darkseid now in the tattoo, so now it's-

03:20:50.260 --> 03:21:00.260
