03:21:10.768 --> 03:21:11.028
Unknown: Yeah.

03:21:11.028 --> 03:21:18.108
Delwath: You're much more likely to be like, "Oh, well, I'm gonna develop a relationship with this tattoo artist and check in with her frequently about-

03:21:18.168 --> 03:21:18.268
Unknown: Right

03:21:18.268 --> 03:21:20.588
Delwath: ... various contexts in Tolan."

03:21:20.668 --> 03:21:25.308
Delwath: Right? Even if it's not, it's just a more of an opportunity for-

03:21:25.368 --> 03:21:25.548
Unknown: Yeah

03:21:25.548 --> 03:21:27.488
Delwath: ... um, like one of the,

03:21:28.548 --> 03:21:33.908
Delwath: one of the NPCs in my other game is like, uh, the temple administrator of-

03:21:34.688 --> 03:21:34.928
Unknown: Mm-hmm

03:21:34.928 --> 03:21:39.008
Delwath: ... the little, the temple, and like, there's constantly reasons to be checking in with her, like-

03:21:39.188 --> 03:21:39.668
Unknown: Yeah

03:21:39.668 --> 03:21:45.288
Delwath: ... like she's not powerful or that important, but like she's a little bit of hub of gossip and it's like-

03:21:45.608 --> 03:21:45.628
Unknown: Yeah

03:21:45.628 --> 03:21:49.108
Delwath: ... it's constantly sort of an opportunity to be like, "Oh, let's go check with Elmore about..."

03:21:49.288 --> 03:21:58.308
Kenzo: I have one. Philosopher's Guild, I think if there were like a clear spokesperson that we were interacting with more, and I think there was one, but that could, that was an opportunity where, 'cause like we were going back for research-

03:21:58.308 --> 03:22:00.088
