03:22:20.468 --> 03:22:21.228
Kenzo: Or, or whatever, you know?

03:22:21.308 --> 03:22:21.328
DM: Yeah.

03:22:21.328 --> 03:22:25.828
Kenzo: Then it's like, oh shit. Like, you're, you get excited to interact with it because there's some kind of a, you know-

03:22:26.568 --> 03:22:32.508
Delwath: I think just the structure of the, the structure of the campaign made it hard to develop too many-

