03:23:51.648 --> 03:23:51.868
Unknown: Yeah.

03:23:51.888 --> 03:23:54.228
Kenzo: And figure out what rooms they were in and blah, blah, blah.

03:23:54.248 --> 03:23:54.268
Unknown: Oh, yeah.

03:23:54.268 --> 03:23:54.708
Unknown: You know?

03:23:54.748 --> 03:23:56.188
